########## CHECK THE RESULTS ##########

### All users
GET {{baseUrl}}/Users

### All forums
GET {{baseUrl}}/Forums

### Posts in the C# forum
GET {{baseUrl}}/Posts?forumId=2

### Comments on post 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/Comments?postId=1

### Reactions on post 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/Reactions?postId=1

########## THINGS THAT SHOULD FAIL ##########

### Duplicate username -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/Users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "anna", "password": "x" }

### Post in a forum that doesn't exist -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/Posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "forumId": 99, "title": "Nope", "body": "Should fail" }

### Same user likes post 1 twice -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/Reactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "type": "Like", "postId": 1 }

### Reaction with both postId and commentId -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Reactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "type": "Like", "postId": 1, "commentId": 1 }